  "_comment_sharia_warnings": "═══ التنبيهات الشرعية ═══",
  "shariaWarningsTitle": "Important Islamic Notices",
  "shariaWarningsCount": "10 notices you must know",
  "warning1Title": "Debts and Wills Must Be Paid First",
  "warning1Content": "Estate is not distributed until:\n• Funeral expenses (washing, shrouding, burial)\n• All debts are paid\n• Wills are executed (up to 1/3 for non-heirs)\n\n\"After any bequest or debt.\" [An-Nisa: 11]",
  "warning2Title": "A Killer Does Not Inherit",
  "warning2Content": "The Prophet ﷺ said: \"A killer does not inherit.\" [Narrated by An-Nasa'i]\nWhether intentional or accidental according to the majority.",
  "warning3Title": "Difference in Religion is a Barrier",
  "warning3Content": "The Prophet ﷺ said: \"A Muslim does not inherit from a disbeliever, nor does a disbeliever inherit from a Muslim.\" [Agreed upon]",
  "warning4Title": "Slavery is a Barrier",
  "warning4Content": "A slave does not inherit nor is inherited (consensus)\nThis barrier no longer exists in our time, praise be to Allah.",
  "warning5Title": "Inheritance of the Unborn",
  "warning5Content": "• The larger share is reserved for the unborn\n• Estate is not finally divided until birth\n• Must be born alive to inherit\n\nThe Prophet ﷺ said: \"If the baby cries (at birth), he inherits.\" [Narrated by Abu Dawud]",
  "warning6Title": "Inheritance of the Missing Person",
  "warning6Content": "• Considered alive regarding his property\n• His share from others' estates is withheld\n• Judge rules on his death after a certain period",
  "warning7Title": "Hermaphrodite Case",
  "warning7Content": "• Given the smaller share as precaution\n• Or the difference is withheld until status is clear\n• In our time, gender can be determined by medical tests",
  "warning8Title": "No Bequest for an Heir",
  "warning8Content": "The Prophet ﷺ said: \"Allah has given each person his due right, so there is no bequest for an heir.\" [Narrated by Abu Dawud and At-Tirmidhi]\n\nUnless with permission of other heirs. Bequest for non-heirs is limited to 1/3.",
  "warning9Title": "Prohibition of Changing Divine Shares",
  "warning9Content": "\"These are the limits of Allah. Whoever obeys Allah and His Messenger will be admitted to Gardens.\"\n\"Whoever disobeys Allah and His Messenger and transgresses His limits will be admitted to the Fire.\" [An-Nisa: 13-14]",
  "warning10Title": "Must Consult a Specialist Scholar",
  "warning10Content": "• This program is for learning purposes only\n• Does not replace consulting a specialized Islamic scholar\n• It is recommended to present each case to an Islamic court\n\n\"Ask the people of knowledge if you do not know.\" [An-Nahl: 43]",
  "inheritanceBlockersTitle": "Three Barriers to Inheritance",
  "blocker1": "Killing",
  "blocker1Desc": "A killer does not inherit",
  "blocker2": "Difference in Religion",
  "blocker2Desc": "No inheritance between Muslim and non-Muslim",
  "blocker3": "Slavery",
  "blocker3Desc": "A slave does not inherit (no longer exists)",
  "blockersPoem": "\"Three things prevent a person from inheritance:\nSlavery, killing, and difference in religion.\nUnderstand this well, for doubt is not like certainty.\"",
